The grooved solitaire is the quietest men's diamond ring on the market. The band does the talking — parallel grooves or ridged lines run the length of the shank. The 1ct stone sits at the top as a deliberate finishing detail, not a showpiece.

Best for: you if you want to wear a diamond ring every day without it reading as jewelry.

