### Setting Type 2 — Channel Set (Complete Band, No Center Stone Needed)

Channel-set men's rings have diamonds already set across the top surface of the band in a flush channel. No center stone required. The 1ct+ equivalent weight is distributed across multiple stones rather than concentrated in one.

This approach gives you more total diamond presence at a lower total cost. The tradeoff is no single focal stone.

