### Setting Type 3 — Pavé Edge (Stone + Band Diamonds)

Pavé edge settings have small diamonds set along the edges of the band. There is an open center head for your 1ct stone. You get diamond presence on the stone and the band at the same time.

This is the most diamond-intensive look in a men's 1ct ring.

