| 15 | [Comfort Fit Channel Tantalum 6mm](https://www.bluenile.com/wedding-rings/comfort-fit-channel-set-grouped-mens-diamond-wedding-band-in-tantalum-600mm-by-james-allen-item-304918?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Tantalum | $1,570 | Built-in | Built-in | **$1,570** | Scratch-proof tantalum + channel diamonds — zero maintenance ring |

